data: {"type":"agent_chunk","agent":"critic","content":"- **Single-source claim:** The HIV cell-culture point rests only on one source, so the \"fully eliminated HIV\" headline needs corroboration.\n- **Uncited claim:** \"Headlines claim CRISPR could treat many diseases\" has no clinical-trial evidence, so the review doesn't show how far the hype outruns the data.\n- **Missing angle:** The review omits off-target cutting and delivery risks, which are central to judging whether the precision claim holds in patients."}

